  <item>
    <title>Vol. 08 中国最有名的“网管”被挤了一回牙膏</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67f237690decaeb0942f5e8b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67f237690decaeb0942f5e8b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 06 Apr 2025 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>日娃可能是中国最著名的“网管”。他初中退学，年少成名，在网络安全领域大展身手。在社会新闻里，他更是怒提五百万整顿银行服务的维权大V。去年九月，他在广州面对话筒如坐针毡。我尽力从这位守口如瓶的黑客那里挤了些牙膏，欢迎收听《开腔》，倾听未曾经历的人生，走近未曾抵达的江湖。</span></p><p><span>嘉宾：日娃（sunwear），天津人。网络安全从业者，热点事件当事人。</span></p><p><span>采录：花总</span><br><span>编辑：甜食</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="137">02:17</a> 学黑客为免费上网</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a> 初二就退学打游戏</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="469">07:49</a> 命运齿轮开始转动</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">09:55</a> 欲语还休的成就感</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a> 在安全圈里的地位</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> 找我麻烦得有证据</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="984">16:24</a> 知道很多人的秘密</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1149">19:09</a> 股市让我有点闹心</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1299">21:39</a> 黑产数据也靠黑客</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1416">23:36</a> 黑掉银行未必值得</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1558">25:58</a> 一个不能说的秘密</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1684">28:04</a> 明哲保身算智慧吗</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1883">31:23</a> 我父母还挺听我的</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2006">33:26</a> 炫富是件快乐的事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2288">38:08</a> 带保镖只为少打架</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2403">40:03</a> 普通人守不住隐私</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/662e8d2f8378d3c66f2bf1ea/lkbvHjn-h4SkSX36JIJGqUHqcy_k.m4a" length="42616539" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:43:13</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FivG-vlprufvbTu09lDp9H_W2puS.png"/>
