  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol. 07 一个爆仓青年的裸奔人生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c4bd7ebf52a16cd10fc1ed</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c4bd7ebf52a16cd10fc1ed</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 02 Mar 2025 23:50:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“94事件”之后，币圈在中国成为灰色地带。有人飞蛾扑火，有人一夜暴富，更多人仍在信仰与欲望的拉扯间挣扎。去年底，徐安从东京飞到香港接受我的采访，讲述了他在十年间如过山车般起伏的故事。欢迎来到《开腔》，倾听未曾经历的人生，走近未曾抵达的江湖。</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：徐安，哈尔滨人。曾在北京、重庆与海外工作，现为旅日加密货币投资者。</span></p><span></span><p><span>采录：花总</span><br><span>制作：甜食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">03:50</a> 一场未遂的裸奔风波</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="654">10:54</a> 一本杂志影响的抉择</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="787">13:07</a> 一次改变眼界的实习</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 一辆重回北京的大巴</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 一堂改变人生的讲座</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1780">29:40</a> 一年考察了三百套房</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2190">36:30</a> 一个新的人生岔路口</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2455">40:55</a> 一卷没看懂的白皮书</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2664">44:24</a> 一次动摇信念的亏损</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3077">51:17</a> 一个被盗币的交易所</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3535">58:55</a> 一觉醒来发现爆仓了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3738">62:18</a> 一次东山再起的机会</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4028">67:08</a> 一桩撞见蜀黍的风波</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4492">74:52</a> 一把梁山交椅的诱惑</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4570">76:10</a> 一次做空导致的强平</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4936">82:16</a> 一场不欢而散的摩擦</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5066">84:26</a> 一段没有结束的远航</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/662e8d2f8378d3c66f2bf1ea/llq9bcGizjBbCYhtO3z-zEWIZcJ7.m4a" length="84620816" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:26:04</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhAYYUHojSKEvxfUO5BwPYRAEf_e.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol. 06 阿龙闯荡记：江湖中间人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67990034247d51713cc1e3c2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67990034247d51713cc1e3c2</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 02 Feb 2025 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>如何把受困园区的亲人解救回国，这个难题让许多家属夜不能寐。阿龙是东南亚一线最有名的“中间人”，他穿梭于黑白之间，度溺水者上岸。去年六月，阿龙首次接受录音采访，自述在鱼龙混杂的泥淖里如何救人，如何看江湖，如何看自己。</span></p><p><span>嘉宾：阿龙，他的自媒体频道《阿龙闯荡记》在“东南亚务工”群体中有极高知名度，阿龙也是反诈电影《孤注一掷》的顾问。</span></p><p><span>采录：花总</span><br><span>制作：甜食</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 我的读者很多都陷身黑灰产</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="363">06:03</a> 他们不知出不了业绩要被打</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="417">06:57</a> 保守估计还有五到八十万人</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a> 行业早已形成整套培训体系</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">09:55</a> 接到求助后通常会做这三步</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 黑灰产也讲一个“盗亦有道”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="833">13:53</a> 从园区里解救了近千名同胞</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="972">16:12</a> 不入江湖怎么能了解江湖事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1073">17:53</a> 真正的救人基本都是靠谈判</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1268">21:08</a> 盘总们在现实中都极其低调</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1296">21:36</a> 疫情时用工荒导致人口贩卖</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a> 老板希望你开开心心搞诈骗</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1507">25:07</a> 小孩问为什么不能晚点救我</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1685">28:05</a> 电诈公司为转型招高优人才</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1883">31:23</a> 很多盘总投几千万最后亏本</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1956">32:36</a> 整个行业被倒逼着优胜劣汰</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2067">34:27</a> 本来想吃肉却成了碗里的肉</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 捞人的比诈骗犯还没有良心</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2428">40:28</a> 给贫困家庭减赔付是伪善吗</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2543">42:23</a> 捞人是个暗流汹涌的深水区</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2665">44:25</a> 打不绝的骗子又换了新套路</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2888">48:08</a> 对方很快会给你发剁手视频</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3062">51:02</a> 解救尼奥的难度其实并不高</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3310">55:10</a> 家属带着兵去园区谈判要人</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3370">56:10</a> 如果营救失败也得赔十几万</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3487">58:07</a> 有时会劝家属别救了不值得</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4041">67:21</a> 曾被大佬悬赏过两百万美金</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4204">70:04</a> 中间人要坚守的底线是什么</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4297">71:37</a> 都是“被利用”只是主体不同</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4339">72:19</a> 为什么总发盘总撕逼的八卦</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4437">73:57</a> 东南亚比你更狠的人有得是</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4536">75:36</a> 许文强来了也是别人的菜单</span></p><p><span>播客中提及的“陈队”与“机车大叔”，是花总2024年纪录片《归途》的主人公。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/662e8d2f8378d3c66f2bf1ea/ltVGJ8MPD_3h8ZK9eg9Cc9Pqpaon.m4a" length="76352706" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:18:41</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FivG-vlprufvbTu09lDp9H_W2puS.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol. 05 逃出妙瓦底：电诈集中营亲历者访谈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6780c35fcda04ef4c1c42342</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6780c35fcda04ef4c1c42342</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 10 Jan 2025 07:35:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>去年春节前，Neo联系到我，希望用亲身经历揭露缅甸妙瓦底电诈集中营的真相。此时他已经逃到第三国，我通过电话对他进行了两轮采访。本期节目详细记录了电诈团伙与电诈活动的内幕细节，大量信息系首次公开。欢迎收听本期《开腔》，和我一起潜入深海寻找故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：Neo，2013年赴英国留学，后因家庭变故辍学。2022年赴泰国应聘，最终陷身缅甸妙瓦底。作为有留学经历的高素质人才，Neo在电诈团伙里升任帐房，由此掌握了犯罪活动的重要内幕。</span></p><span></span><p><span>采录：花总</span><br><span>制作：甜食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="116">01:56</a> 前往泰国</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="345">05:45</a> 来到湄索</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="628">10:28</a> T字路口</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="794">13:14</a> 穿越界河</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="855">14:15</a> 你别想逃</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1017">16:57</a> 泰国电话卡</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1255">20:55</a> 检查站</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1460">24:20</a> 敲了园区的门</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1715">28:35</a> 我们就是杀猪盘</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1802">30:02</a> 物业带我去宿舍</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1886">31:26</a> 窝点内部</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2012">33:32</a> 代号四零一</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2084">34:44</a> 组长与劳力士</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2300">38:20</a> 如果我真想做诈骗就留在迪拜了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2407">40:07</a> 舍友们</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2560">42:40</a> 赔付</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2753">45:53</a> 为什么让我做财务</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2861">47:41</a> 喜哥和强子</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2973">49:33</a> 大部分是中国人</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3173">52:53</a> 剧本为王</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3265">54:25</a> 流水有多少</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3386">56:26</a> 诈骗成本有多少</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3580">59:40</a> 大部分小组并不盈利</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3669">61:09</a> 通过饭卡估算团队规模</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3807">63:27</a> 交了赔付就能放人吗</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3899">64:59</a> 财务组</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4108">68:28</a> 和北京时间同步</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4296">71:36</a> 请高手培训</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4431">73:51</a> 电诈用户画像</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4595">76:35</a> 别发美食图片</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4680">78:00</a> 黄推引流</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4895">81:35</a> 筛选客户</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5129">85:29</a> 社会工程</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5565">92:45</a> 买料成本</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5840">97:20</a> 叫业务员是为了维护士气</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5965">99:25</a> 怎么分赃</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6070">101:10</a> 被剥削的底层</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6360">106:00</a> 如何发薪水</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6530">108:50</a> 电诈团伙的层级</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6675">111:15</a> 共存共荣</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6857">114:17</a> 喜哥的发迹史与烦恼</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7153">119:13</a> 为什么闹掰</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7335">122:15</a> 开始联系媒体</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7650">127:30</a> 取证</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7823">130:23</a> 被关小黑屋</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8021">133:41</a> 风险预判</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8105">135:05</a> 我要反击</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8209">136:49</a> 关于东美</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8437">140:37</a> 从泰国回国</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8614">143:34</a> 如何逃离园区</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8706">145:06</a> 摊牌与角力</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8999">149:59</a> 将军</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9527">158:47</a> 供应链不可或缺的一环</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/662e8d2f8378d3c66f2bf1ea/lqcVjg9axwSRwqu-N0Sd2r96UgbB.m4a" length="116687796" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>02:39:46</itunes:duration>
