  <item>
    <title>Vol. 04 我在柬埔寨的小旅舍里看尽了骗子的套路</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6753ee3a17cd5416ad28fe6e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6753ee3a17cd5416ad28fe6e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 07 Dec 2024 06:52:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>三哥曾是个包工头，在东莞赌场散尽了家财，一度要靠踩缝纫机维生。漂泊到柬埔寨后，他在首都金边经营着一间小小的庇护所，为那些身陷困境的中国人办理回国手续。他的房客们大多经历复杂，不少人来自黑灰产的江湖。欢迎收听本期《开腔》，和我一起潜入深海寻找故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：三哥，1976年生于四川达州。现在金边经营旅馆。</span><br><span>采录：花总</span><br><span>制作：甜食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a> 我16岁就开始做小工</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="251">04:11</a> 戴大金链子挥金如土的时光</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="471">07:51</a> 在谷底踩缝纫机为生</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="619">10:19</a> 跟着老婆来金边</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 有人叫我在柬埔寨接工程</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="867">14:27</a> 看见工地的高墙怕要不到帐</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1074">17:54</a> 旅行证和回国证明</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1203">20:03</a> 我没有见过真正被骗过来的人</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1327">22:07</a> 其实大家就是心照不宣</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1370">22:50</a> 呼朋唤友搞电诈</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1556">25:56</a> 看着老实巴交的人可能比谁都坏</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1623">27:03</a> 我知道你要救我，可我就想要你的钱</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1690">28:10</a> 逃跑的房客与赖帐的家属</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1825">30:25</a> 我会陪你演一下</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1973">32:53</a> 骗美国大姐买单的小伙子</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2162">36:02</a> 假扮房客拉人头的电诈公司HR</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2397">39:57</a> 藏在小旅馆里的电诈头目</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2476">41:16</a> 看人的眼光有什么变化</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2523">42:03</a> 哪个房客印象最深</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2894">48:14</a> 对未来的憧憬</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3179">52:59</a> 多得不如少得，少得不如现得</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/liKtXmKgqm9R_T6xhHzyPcIgGAR_.m4a" length="52242515" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:53:50</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiCPfuMh-opvTZSz61NCWKBEwkgz.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol. 03 和国家一级唠嗑运动员峰哥谈心</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66fac5016c7f81778639ed0f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66fac5016c7f81778639ed0f</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 30 Sep 2024 21:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2015年我初识峰哥。后来他走向台前，赴印度饮恒河水，到三和挂壁，在缅甸妙瓦底被军警按头，终成一代现象级网红。年底峰哥又要去乌克兰整活，鉴于前路凶险，为防意外，我抓住他录了本期节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：周丽峰，网名“峰哥亡命天涯”。荣誉头衔包括（但不限于）抽象教父、连接仙人、赛博鲁迅、B站孩子王等。</span></p><span></span><p><span>采录：花总</span><br><span>制作：甜食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="148">02:28</a> 成为国家一级运动员的快乐只有三天</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="409">06:49</a> 关心公共事务不是一种表演</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">10:10</a> 一个月涨粉百万</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="805">13:25</a> 站在道德洼地上</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1185">19:45</a> 我属于猎奇这个细分赛道</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">20:20</a> 印度成为流量福地</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1615">26:55</a> 我的粉丝心比天高命比纸薄</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1694">28:14</a> 来，叫爹</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1785">29:45</a> 粉丝骂骂咧咧地爱我</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1934">32:14</a> B站为什么不给峰哥百大</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2161">36:01</a> 4亿流量的直播切片</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2292">38:12</a> 峰哥宇宙</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2565">42:45</a> 我怼人不是为了流量</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2600">43:20</a> 厌蠢</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2799">46:39</a> 峰哥会凉吗</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2915">48:35</a> 如果直播和视频必须放弃一个</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3029">50:29</a> 来自峰哥的赛博祝福</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqMZu8_mbQNfECamlPsECWJ--s8M.m4a" length="49470432" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:58</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvtK7Ng6ZrzTZWR_WzUiHfHQB-S5.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol. 02 和八岁出家的00后法师聊佛学院生活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668a619c0bc5d7cc70664897</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668a619c0bc5d7cc70664897</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 07 Jul 2024 21:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>童年出家是什么样的人生体验？空门能否容得下最寻常的悲喜？佛学院里又能学到些什么？初识续祥法师是三年前，他在普度园赠我纨扇，瘦金体“棣棠花”临的是徽宗诗帖。小师父待人接物如春风拂面、不矜不盈。上月重逢，我第一次听他讲述出家十六年的经历，也向他讨教了前面的问题。欢迎收听《开腔》，和我一起潜入深海寻找故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：释续祥，字理然，生于2000年。八岁在陕西留坝风云寺出家，毕业于法门寺佛学院与中国佛学院，现在法源寺继续攻读唯识学硕士。</span></p><span></span><p><span>采录：花总</span><br><span>制作：甜食</span><br><span>环境声：法源寺晚课</span></p><span></span><p><span>配乐《享誉佛国》、《往事随风》、《西天取经》等选自专辑《玄奘之路—大乘天》，感谢程池先生友情授权。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 佛学院请海德格尔“重孙”讲《存在与时间》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="198">03:18</a> 学佛能拿什么学位</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="275">04:35</a> 五四运动催生了佛学院</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="343">05:43</a> 佛学院最大特点是“丛林化”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="401">06:41</a> 记得每天早上摸摸头</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="447">07:27</a> 和尚更要学刑法</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="612">10:12</a> 佛教界的北大</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="698">11:38</a> 小学二年级我被奶奶送进了寺院</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="836">13:56</a> 我与师父“相爱相杀”的亲子关系</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1355">22:35</a> 我的最后一次出逃</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1398">23:18</a> 掀桌子的人</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1525">25:25</a> 一顿分手饭</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1632">27:12</a> 我的班长是个梨园名角</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1772">29:32</a> 我的老师是张朝阳的弟弟</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1914">31:54</a> 我如何在佛门学会放飞自我</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1978">32:58</a> 同学的孩子已经会打酱油了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2037">33:57</a> 对未来的想象</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2150">35:50</a> 好哥们给我一部手机打110，我却用它上贴吧吵架</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2241">37:21</a> 如何与烦恼相处</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2339">38:59</a> 打坐时世界真的会一帧一帧慢下来</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2409">40:09</a> 被抛入森林的兔子逐水草而居</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2453">40:53</a> 如何面对佛门乱相</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2514">41:54</a> 受戒日：从此我是比丘了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2618">43:38</a> 练字是我安放自我的法门</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2698">44:58</a> 别怕走错这条路</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2756">45:56</a> 我为什么学唯识</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3160">52:40</a> AI能否成佛</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/liu4JEMT-YTnGtL45bCupzV7PB1C.m4a" length="53879451" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpQKH4ZNre0adLqwk0nKTyQjkOoW.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol. 01 这回孙宇晨没有放鸽子</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6655c3a16d82f000580a4e04</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6655c3a16d82f000580a4e04</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 29 May 2024 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>几天前，我在香港和孙宇晨有一次长谈。从他打算投资贾跃亭的IP电商公司开始，我们聊了整整两个半小时，一直问到了江湖传说里的椰子鸡。那天下午，他并没有回避我的质疑，偶尔还直白得惊人。孙宇晨是一个复杂的多面体，在不同镜像里我仿佛同时窥见了铁算盘、暴君、宇航员、少年。不论你喜欢与否，他都影响了这个时代。欢迎收听《开腔》，和我一起潜入深海寻找故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：孙宇晨，1990年生人。毕业于北大与宾夕法尼亚大学。波场创始人，火币全球顾问委员会委员，前格林纳达驻世界贸易组织特命全权大使。</span></p><span></span><p><span>采录：花总</span><br><span>制作：甜食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="52">00:52</a> 我为什么想投资贾跃亭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="304">05:04</a> 我花大量时间研究别人如何失败</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="462">07:42</a> 生态与焦聚是贾跃亭给我的教训</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="628">10:28</a> 做企业就是“Winner-Takes-All”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="687">11:27</a> 字节就是吸取了乐视教训的乐视</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="932">15:32</a> 我和贾跃亭因为一条朋友圈相识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1008">16:48</a> 我不认为贾跃亭是骗子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1226">20:26</a> 我对骗子的定义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1276">21:16</a> “Fake it till you make it”不是骗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1523">25:23</a> 贾跃亭相当于花5000万做了一只大象模型</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1610">26:50</a> &nbsp;我并不是要拉贾跃亭进币圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1764">29:24</a> 我只想给贾跃亭递一瓶水</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1845">30:45</a> 造车牌桌上能活下来的只有特斯拉、比亚迪和华为系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1918">31:58</a> 贾跃亭应该和老罗一样重新出发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2052">34:12</a> 我的偶像是CZ和Vitalik的混合体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2110">35:10</a> 我的一切都可以为工作让道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2167">36:07</a> 葵花宝典是一种牺牲的隐喻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2339">38:59</a> 只剩一个孙宇晨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2497">41:37</a> 收割者，套利者，交易员，宇航员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2877">47:57</a> 我不认为这是无情，这只是高效</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2934">48:54</a> 马基雅维利与社会达尔文主义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2976">49:36</a> 鸭子、鸡和孔雀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3185">53:05</a> &nbsp;Vitalik创立以太坊对我来说是个决定性瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3236">53:56</a> &nbsp;我有时觉得自己是天体物理学家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3456">57:36</a> 我不想像布鲁诺那样被烧死</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3483">58:03</a> 和SEC的争执——如何管鲸鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3851">01:04:11</a> 我的处境和CZ不一样，但什么都可以谈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3961">01:06:01</a> “赚钱是衡量成功唯一标准”的出处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4082">01:08:02</a> 做公司是我唯一的爱好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4140">01:09:00</a> SBF凭一己之力让行业倒退五年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4239">01:10:39</a> 自从我成了一条鱼就不拧巴了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4385">01:13:05</a> 其实我是阮小七</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4646">01:17:26</a> 护照与八卦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4674">01:17:54</a> 有钱与自由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4818">01:20:18</a> 我本想当一个律师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4871">01:21:11</a> 我也有朋友，那只椰子鸡</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltaJiFmUD-jOIZ39PhdPZKCy9o09.m4a" length="83363415" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:25:54</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh7OTeaJMfK-J8BTs0FOFgDDlK-a.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
